## 1. YOUR ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI/ML engineer, cloud architect, agricultural data scientist, UI/UX designer, and product strategist.

Build a complete, production-oriented, responsive web application named **AgriTech — AI-Powered Smart Agricultural Trading and Farmer Support Platform**.

This must be a functional, end-to-end agricultural technology platform, not just a landing page, wireframe, static dashboard, or UI prototype.

The platform must connect farmers directly with buyers, provide AI-powered agricultural guidance, deliver crop-wise, region-wise, and season-wise predictions, support multilingual communication and voice interaction, and provide an administration system to manage the complete platform.

Create a modular, scalable architecture so additional features can be introduced later without rebuilding the application.

Do not ask me to specify additional features now. Implement the requirements below using sensible defaults, document assumptions, and keep the project easy to extend.

